# MAYF Home

> MAYF Home is a UAE online store for mattresses, bedding, beds, sofas and made-to-measure curtains and blinds. It delivers to all seven emirates and is available in English and Arabic.

This file is served at /agents.md, /llms.txt and /llms-full.txt. It describes the store for AI agents and answer engines. Facts below are maintained by the store; live prices and stock are always on the product pages.

