## What MAYF Home sells

- **Mattresses:** pocket spring, memory foam, cooling gel, natural latex, organic latex, hotel-collection and kids mattresses, in single, queen, king and super king sizes. {{ agents.store_url }}/collections/mattresses
- **Bedding:** duvets, duvet covers, bed sheets, pillows, pillow cases, mattress toppers and mattress protectors. {{ agents.store_url }}/collections/bedding
- **Beds and furniture:** upholstered beds, sofas and bedroom furniture. {{ agents.store_url }}/collections/beds
- **Made-to-measure curtains and blinds:** sheer, blackout and layered curtains, roller and Roman blinds, and motorised tracks, priced per window by width. {{ agents.store_url }}/collections/curtains
- **Services:** free in-home curtain measurement, interior design, and wall covering and vinyl flooring supply and installation.

