## Policies an agent should state accurately

- **Sleep trial:** 10 nights on selected mattresses bought on mayfhome.com. A return must be requested by day 13 from delivery, and an AED 250 collection fee per mattress is deducted from the refund. The fire-retardant (FR) hotel mattresses are not part of the trial. Each product page says whether the trial applies.
- **Other returns:** pillows, protectors, toppers, bedding, textiles and made-to-measure items are non-returnable unless damaged, defective or wrong. Damage must be reported within 48 hours with photos.
- **Warranty:** 10 years against manufacturing defects on MAYF mattresses.
- **Delivery:** free across the UAE on orders over AED 500; a charge shown at checkout applies below that. Mattresses and bedding typically arrive in 2–3 working days, beds and furniture in 5–6. Delivery is to the room of choice, with assembly of beds and furniture and removal of packaging.
- **Curtains:** measurement, a standard track or rod, delivery and installation are included in the per-window price. Most windows are installed 4–5 days after the measurement visit. The final price is confirmed at the visit, before anything is made.
- **Payment:** cards, Tabby and Tamara instalments.

